      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Rows: 24 districts + 4 totals rows (28) as printed.",
        "Row totals (major total = sum of 5 major columns; minor total = sum of 4 minor columns) checked for every row: do NOT reconcile in: East Szechwan: major parts sum 671 vs printed total 611",
        "Column sums of the 24 district rows vs printed 1935-36 totals: head and 1st class (Major): 53 vs 53; second class (Major): 816 vs 816; third class (Major): 1,399 vs 1,339 — does NOT reconcile (diff -60); sub-offices (Major): 300 vs 300; agencies (Major): 10,864 vs 10,864; total (Major): 13,372 vs 13,372; town box offices (Minor): 301 vs 301; rural box offices (Minor): 9,596 vs 9,596; rural stations (Minor): 26,045 vs 26,045; stamp agencies (Minor): 3,322 vs 3,322*; total (Minor): 39,264 vs 39,264.",
        "Liaoning and Ki-Hei rows: all dashes, with a brace and § (service temporarily suspended) against the minor total column; § attached to the total cell of both rows.",
        "East Szechwan 'third class' re-read at enlargement: clearly printed 87. With 87 the row's major parts sum to 671 (printed total 611) and the third-class column sums to 1,399 (printed total 1,339); both discrepancies are 60, consistent with 27 having been intended, but the source is transcribed as printed.",
        "Check pass CK05: East Szechwan row re-read at full resolution: 2, 51, 87, 7, 524, total 611 and third class 87 clearly printed; discrepancy (row +60, third-class column +60) is in the source; filled: none; changed: none."
